.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt KLDLOAD-SYSDIAG 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm kldload-sysdiag
.Nd the workstation's own diagnostic console, F-keys like the operator console's
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl h | -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
opens, or returns to, a
.Xr tmux 1
session named
.Ql sysdiag :
the same F-key arrangement as
.Xr kldload-console 8 ,
pointed at this machine rather than the lab and cluster \(em disks, ZFS,
processes, the network.
F1, or typing
.Ql menu
or
.Ql help ,
shows the key sheet.
Each key runs a named shell function
.Pq Ql _sys_disk , Ql _sys_zfs , No ...
that the assistant can also call.
The two sessions can run side by side.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print the header comment and exit 0.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr tmux 1 ,
.Xr kldload-console 8 ,
.Xr kldload-doctor 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An kldload Aq Mt anthony@kldload.com
